# Source-grounded recipe: Wave VII — Voyager, CD3-6.
# The tape's preparatory process is expanded through the existing reusable
# components; its authored exercise remains one segment rather than being
# paraphrased here. No generic briefing, Clear Skies or extra hold is added.
# The source body itself guides the listener back to physical waking awareness; no second countdown is added.
#
# The affirmation is the 1977 original rather than the settled form: the
# route enters F23, F25 and F26, which levels.json marks as populated by minds
# the listener did not choose. The tape's own preparatory process is
# expanded through reusable components, so which affirmation fills that
# slot is this library's choice and not a claim about the source.

@title    Messages From Beyond
@level    F10
@ending   return
@pan      right
@seed     20033
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use orientation

surf 0.30
use conversion-box

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use affirmation-1977

surf 0.0
use relax-10
use climb-f10-f12
use climb-f12-f15
use climb-f15-f21
use climb-f21-f23
use climb-f23-f25
use climb-f25-f26
use climb-f26-f27
use messages-from-beyond
level F1
